egularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026","name":"thm:main","printed_number":"1.1","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"f047bac96ee80ebef0b4f5a403831b84de6e32c1","binding":{"file":"build/sections/introduction.tex","label":"thm:main","line":46,"manuscript":"Interior-regularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026","statement_sha256":"86ba7058b51c1bbfcb37e5853c82f52380c313291c938d60d6633ffd20e87758"},"blob_sha256":"sha256:253ae0683558fd095a71d6f47ab0694d8d98b846c1a65d2bbf9b145d484af567","kind":"reading-page-computed","pdf_verified":false,"pin":"f047bac96ee80ebef0b4f5a403831b84de6e32c1","renderer":"scripts/build_papers.py","source":"data/statement_numbers.json","upstream_pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb"},"printed_number_status":"recorded","reading_page":"papers/Interior-regularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026.html#thm:main","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:38c556b0f915b199898cd72590d98d018c8d8f2ae44eeb19eef5345e67d8b29b","file":"preprints/Interior-regularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":46,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"86ba7058b51c1bbfcb37e5853c82f52380c313291c938d60d6633ffd20e87758","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Interior-regularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:38c556b0f915b199898cd72590d98d018c8d8f2ae44eeb19eef5345e67d8b29b","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Interior-regularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L46"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nLet $(u,K)$ be a reduced absolute minimizer of\n\\eqref{eq:original-energy} in a bounded Lipschitz domain\n$\\Omega\\subset\\mathbb R^2$, with $g\\in L^\\infty(\\Omega)$.\nEvery $x\\in K$ has an interior neighborhood in which $K$ has one of the\nfollowing forms, with $C^{1,\\alpha}$ arcs for some $\\alpha>0$:\n\\begin{enumerate}[label=\\textup{(\\roman*)},nosep]\n \\item a single embedded arc with $x$ in its interior;\n \\item a single embedded arc ending at $x$;\n \\item three embedded arcs meeting only at $x$, with pairwise angles\n       $120$ degrees.\n\\end{enumerate}\nMoreover, for every open $U\\Subset\\Omega$,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:component-finiteness}\n \\#\\{C\\in\\pi_0(K):C\\cap U\\ne\\varnothing\\}<\\infty,\n\\end{equation}\nwhere $\\pi_0(K)$ denotes the set of global connected components of $K$."},{"appendix":false,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:7fab2db290af47f4ec7ca35cfbc10fb256639e251aa26c6ee3a33fc514af836f","grain":"paper-statement","id":"Interior-regularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026#prop:initial-reduction","title":"Reduction to a rectifiable pair"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/2f4720315ded93d43a741ca9.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Proposition","id":"r:Interior-regularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026:prop:initial-reduction","manuscript_id":"p:Interior-regularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026","name":"Reduction to a rectifiable pair","printed_number":"2.1","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"f047bac96ee80ebef0b4f5a403831b84de6e32c1","binding":{"file":"build/sections/reductions.tex","label":"prop:initial-reduction","line":25,"manuscript":"Interior-regularity-of-planar-Mumford-Shah-minimizers-September-24-2026","statement_sha256":"d